<title>USA: Union Planters Q1 EPS $0.84 vs $0.68 diluted.</title>
<headline>Union Planters Q1 EPS $0.84 vs $0.68 diluted.</headline>
<dateline>MEMPHIS, Tenn. 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Planters Corporation</p>
<p>		    Financial Highlights (Unaudited)</p>
<p>		(Dollars in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>							Three Months Ended</p>
<p>								March 31,</p>
<p>							   1997	 1996</p>
<p>Income statement amounts</p>
