<p> Net earnings - primary			     .86	   .70</p>
<p>		  - fully diluted		     .84	   .68</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 results relfect the pooling of interest accounting for five mergers.</p>
<p>Net interest income increased 5.1 percent, year-to-year, while the net interest margin was 4.71 percent in the 1997 quarter, vs 4.37 percent in 1996.</p>
<p>Net charge-offs for the quarter were $15.3 million vs $9 million, and the provision for loan losses was $12.4 million vs $12.9 million.</p>
